@startuml
title UML sequence behaviour — Fill seats and start together
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #344054
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #344054
  FontColor #101828
}
skinparam package {
  BorderColor #667085
  FontColor #101828
  BackgroundColor #F9FAFB
}
box "Frontend — Ride app (ride application)" #E0F2FE
  participant "LobbyStore" as lobby
  participant "RaceStore" as race
  participant "LiveSessionStore" as store
end box
box "Frontend — Ride app (domain library)" #E0F2FE
  participant "RideClock" as rideclock
end box
box "Backend — Telo.Ride.Api" #D1FADF
  participant "RideHub" as hub
  participant "RideHubNotifier" as notifier
end box
box "Backend — Telo.Ride.Application and Domain" #ECFDF3
  participant "TickLiveSessionsCommandHandler" as tick
  participant "RaceSession" as session
end box
box "Backend — Telo.Ride.Infrastructure" #FFF4E5
  participant "SessionTicker" as ticker
  participant "InMemoryRaceSessionRegistry" as registry
end box
loop every 1 s on TimeProvider, until the start
  ticker -> tick : Send TickLiveSessionsCommand(now)
  tick -> registry : Lobbies(now)
  registry --> tick : Sessions not started
  opt StartsAt - now <= 10 s, not yet filled
    tick -> session : Tick(now): bots take every open seat, ready
    session --> tick : 10 / 10 (L2-121 AC2)
    tick -> notifier : SeatsChanged(sessionId, seats)
    notifier --> store : SeatsChanged
  end
end
lobby -> lobby : From 0:03 on server time (startsAt minus the offset), 3, 2, 1 over the inert lobby, ready or not (L2-053 AC4, L2-056)
lobby -> lobby : Go at startsAt; open /race/:mapId/ride?mode=online&session=<id>
race -> store : join({ kind: race, sessionId })
store -> hub : ServerTime x5, measure the offset; JoinRace(sessionId)
hub -> session : Rejoin(rider): the held seat, before or after the start
hub --> store : sessionId, startsAt, seat, seats
store --> race : race, offset
race -> rideclock : start(startsAt minus offset); clocks within 250 ms (L2-121 AC3)
note right of race : No server message marks the start: every client holds startsAt,\nas a group class does (slice 14.4). A race opened early holds at 0:00 until it.
@enduml
